{"id":"cheville","lemma":"cheville","pos":"noun","rank":3170,"glosses":["ankle","dowel, peg","wall plug"],"ipa":"/ʃə.vij/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/80/Fr-cheville.ogg/Fr-cheville.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"chevilles"},"formAudio":{"chevilles":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4c/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-chevilles.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Il s'est foulé la cheville.","en":"He sprained his ankle.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"oneself / if"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"sprained"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Je me suis foulé la cheville.","en":"I twisted my ankle.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"am","l":"être"},{"g":"sprained"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"C'est ainsi que je me suis blessé la cheville.","en":"That's how I injured my ankle.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,null,{"g":"I"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"am","l":"être"},{"g":"injured, wounded"},{"g":"the / her"},null],"phrases":[[2,4,"as, just as, like"]]},{"text":"Vos chevilles sont-elles enflées lorsque vous vous réveillez le matin ?","en":"Are your ankles swollen when you wake up in the morning?","words":[{"g":"your, belonging to you","l":"votre"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"they"},{"g":"swollen","l":"enflé"},{"g":"when"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to awaken","l":"réveiller"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"morning"}]},{"text":"Personne ne lui arrive à la cheville en terme de force.","en":"Nobody equals him in strength.","words":[{"g":"no one, nobody"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"him, he, it"},{"g":"to arrive","l":"arriver"},null,null,null,{"g":"in / of it"},{"g":"terms"},null,null],"phrases":[[4,6,"a la"],[9,11,"by force"]]}]}